  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Imperial Court blessed land, Fang Yuan activates the killer move Four Arm Wind King against an eerie fire dragon python: more than ten Gu spend crystal purple primeval essence at once, two bronze arms grow, and he dives like a comet into fierce combat. The aftermath is milder than before partly because the python lacks human wisdom and cannot find Fang Yuan’s weakness in battle; if the wind is restricted, his state is much worse, and the move has little fire path defense.",
      "chapters": [
        548
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later uses it again to thrash an azure myriad wolf king before subduing it.",
      "chapters": [
        549
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Before the named cast, he swaps earth overlord Gu for Wind Overlord Gu and adjusts the other supplementary Gu so he need not stand on the ground and fights best in wind; stronger wind raises the battle strength he can show and shrinks post-move drawbacks, while a windless fight leaves consequences no better than before. He treats four arm earth king as only a starting point toward fixing strength-enslavement dual cultivation weakness.",
      "chapters": [
        546
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "from-four-arm-earth-king",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_earth_overlord_gu",
        "gu_wind_overlord_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With azure wolves for enslavement path and four arm wind king for strength path, plus battle experience, he places himself at the peak among mortals, yet judges that set still short against a Gu Immortal. Creating four arm wind king had already spent almost all of his previous life’s foundation in those side paths.",
      "chapters": [
        554
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "peak-among-mortals",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_strength",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He names the move’s Gu pairing: Wind Overlord Gu and Tyrant Strength Gu substitute for borrow strength Gu at under half the effect, so obtaining borrow strength Gu would raise the killer move to a new level.",
      "chapters": [
        560
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "gu-pairing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_tyrant_strength_gu",
        "gu_borrow_strength_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later recollection states four arm earth king was a hurried strength path result full of flaws, and after improvement it became four arm wind king.",
      "chapters": [
        569
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "origin-recollection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Six arm heavenly zombie king is about ten times as strong as four arm earth king and four arm wind king.",
      "chapters": [
        570
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "strength-ceiling",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
